From a692f77a5e13b1630cd07f0c84b72fc2d1570e08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 23:32:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add missing Gradle wrapper jar; remove Windows-only
 gradle.properties

- Add gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar (Gradle 9.1.0) so ./gradlew works on a fresh clone.
- Mark gradlew executable.
- Delete gradle.properties; its only line hardcoded org.gradle.java.home to a
  Windows path, which makes Gradle fail to start anywhere else.

Decision: the daemon JDK comes from JAVA_HOME (or a per-machine ~/.gradle/gradle.properties) instead of the repo.
Open: build still needs a local JDK 25 for the toolchain; no auto-provisioning is configured.
---
 gradle.properties                 |   1 -
 gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar | Bin 0 -> 45457 bytes
 gradlew                           |   0
 3 files changed, 1 deletion(-)
 delete mode 100644 gradle.properties
 create mode 100644 gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
 mode change 100644 => 100755 gradlew

diff --git a/gradle.properties b/gradle.properties
deleted file mode 100644
index d3fa7e9..0000000
--- a/gradle.properties
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1 +0,0 @@
-org.gradle.java.home=C:\\Program Files\\Java\\jdk-21
diff --git a/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar b/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..8bdaf60c75ab801e22807dde59e12a8735a34077
GIT binary patch
